=Evaluate whether this local business is a good potential customer.

MY BUSINESS: {{ $('Config').first().json.my_business }}
MY OFFER: {{ $('Config').first().json.my_offer }}
IDEAL CUSTOMER: {{ $('Config').first().json.ideal_customer }}

LEAD
Name: {{ $json.name }}
Category: {{ $json.category }}
Address: {{ $json.address }}
Distance from city centre: {{ $json.distance_km }} km
Website: {{ $json.website }}
Contact email found: {{ $json.email || 'none' }}
Site title: {{ $json.site_title }}
Site description: {{ $json.site_description }}

<website_text>
{{ $json.site_text }}
</website_text>

Return ONLY one valid JSON object with exactly these keys, no markdown fences:
{
  "score": integer 0-10 (10 = ideal customer),
  "business_summary": "1-2 sentences on what they do",
  "pain_points": ["up to 3, only if supported by the data"],
  "fit_reason": "why they do or do not fit",
  "personalization_hook": "one specific true detail from their site or listing, or empty string",
  "recommended_angle": "one sentence on how to pitch them"
}

